}]}]},{\"module_number\":3,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1222,\"title\":\"Advanced JavaScript and TypeScript\",\"code\":\"FE403\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-10-20\",\"end_date\":\"2025-11-07\",\"program\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Front-end Development\",\"code\":\"FE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Cyber.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":3,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":85,\"feedback\":\"Great code and code organization. Hope to see you in December.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Christopher Baker\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3767\\/conversions\\/Christopher-Baker_cut-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1187,\"title\":\"Introduction to Computer Networking\",\"code\":\"CSEC203BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-09-29\",\"end_date\":\"2025-10-17\",\"program\":{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Cyber Security\",\"code\":\"CSEC\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":3,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":100,\"feedback\":\"You've definitely mastered all concepts and skills covered by the module.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Anton Topchiy\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3253\\/conversions\\/942ba360-c1b0-11ed-9bd6-99d24a6f38b4-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Senior Backend Developer at Byrd\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":4,\"courses\":[]},{\"module_number\":5,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1238,\"title\":\"Designing Apps and APIs\",\"code\":\"FE405\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-12-01\",\"end_date\":\"2025-12-19\",\"program\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Front-end Development\",\"code\":\"FE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Cyber.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":5,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":90,\"feedback\":\"We're looking for the business problem and the business solution. You've described the issues that their current system has, but why does your system do what they need it todo?\\nSimilarly, what are the risks of the product, not just the technical risks?\\nGood addition with \\\"The Future\\\"!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Christopher Baker\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3767\\/conversions\\/Christopher-Baker_cut-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1200,\"title\":\"Android Development\",\"code\":\"CS405BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-11-10\",\"end_date\":\"2025-11-28\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":5,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":100,\"feedback\":\"Highest score in the course, keep it up! Attention to details, active participation in lectures, homework submitted ahead of time, beautiful design, good technical solutions. If you continue to work in the same spirit, you will achieve great success in IT.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Bulat Mukhutdinov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3570\\/conversions\\/8d6ff720-5954-11ef-8df0-e5e4ac5f1907-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Principal Android Engineer at inDrive\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":6,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1275,\"title\":\"Modern Web Application 2 - From MVP to Deployed App\",\"code\":\"CS406\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-01-12\",\"end_date\":\"2026-01-30\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Interactive.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":6,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":90,\"feedback\":\"Your presentation was excellent and exceptionally well-prepared, showcasing a highly polished and complete application. You demonstrated outstanding mastery of the subject matter, reasoning skillfully through questions about extending and improving your work. Your thorough understanding and attention to detail made the presentation a true pleasure to experience. The main features were clearly highlighted, reflecting both technical expertise and thoughtful implementation. Additionally, I know it is not easy to be the only remote participant, so congrats once again!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Nico Deblauwe\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2790\\/conversions\\/620-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Freelance Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1206,\"title\":\"DevOps\",\"code\":\"DS406BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2025-12-01\",\"end_date\":\"2025-12-19\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":6,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":100,\"feedback\":\"Wai Lin Aung is one of the top performers in the class. \\n\\nHis passion to the homelab exploration lead him to pass exam and home assignments effortlessly. \\n\\nKeep it up!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Maksym Prokopov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2815\\/conversions\\/645-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Cloud Chief Architect\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":7,\"courses\":[]},{\"module_number\":8,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1287,\"title\":\"React Web\",\"code\":\"FE408\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-02-23\",\"end_date\":\"2026-03-13\",\"program\":{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Front-end Development\",\"code\":\"FE\",\"degree\":\"Bachelor\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":3,\"credits\":180,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":32,\"tuition_fee\":19900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Bachelor of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Hyper.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":8,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":96,\"feedback\":\"Great job on the finals! Hope to see you in React Native!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Christopher Baker\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/3767\\/conversions\\/Christopher-Baker_cut-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Full Stack Developer\"}]},{\"id\":1255,\"title\":\"Mathematical Foundations of Computing\",\"code\":\"CS108BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-02-02\",\"end_date\":\"2026-02-20\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":8,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":77,\"feedback\":\"Hi Aung! Maybe this was not your best possible grade here - but I see that you can do math and algorithms well, and you will surely be able to learn and develop any related skills if you need them for an interesting project! Good luck!\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Serhii Denysov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2672\\/conversions\\/437-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Lecturer at Kyiv National Taras Shevchenko University\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":9,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1263,\"title\":\"Data Storages\",\"code\":\"CS409BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-02-23\",\"end_date\":\"2026-03-13\",\"program\":{\"id\":16,\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"code\":\"CS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"09:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":9,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":88,\"feedback\":\"Wai Lin Aung was the member of \\\"\\\"TICKET_ANALYTICS\\\"\\\" project,  quite interesting.  Their project was intersting as an idea, but very simple in implementation, comparing with another projects. He sometimes participated in discussions in class, with some interesing opinions. He got great quiz results, so I suppose he got the best level of understanding of data storages.... And I suppose he forgot to hand on his 4-th task.\\r\\n quiz correct answers:54\\r\\n tasks 1:100, 2:100, 3:90, 4:0 \\r\\n participation:50\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Nikolay Golov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2806\\/conversions\\/636-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Head of Data Platform at ManyChat\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":10,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1267,\"title\":\"Fundamentals of Operating Systems\",\"code\":\"CSEC210BKK\",\"credits\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":true,\"start_date\":\"2026-03-16\",\"end_date\":\"2026-04-03\",\"program\":{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Cyber Security\",\"code\":\"CSEC\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"13:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Growth.Space\",\"academic_year\":\"2025\",\"module_number\":10,\"type\":null,\"result\":{\"grade\":64,\"feedback\":\"Good potential but inconsistent results.\"},\"teachers\":[{\"full_name\":\"Konstanin Yegupov\",\"photo\":\"https:\\/\\/student-space-storage.ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\\/person\\/photo\\/2814\\/conversions\\/644-thumb.jpg\",\"position\":\"Software Engineer at Modeldrive\"}]}]},{\"module_number\":11,\"courses\":[{\"id\":1319,\"title\":\"Integrated Data Engineering and Analysis on Google Cloud Platform\",\"code\":\"DS411BKK\",\"credits\":6,\"status\":\"registered\",\"student_feedback_submitted\":false,\"start_date\":\"2026-04-27\",\"end_date\":\"2026-05-15\",\"program\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Data Science\",\"code\":\"DS\",\"degree\":\"Master\",\"campus\":\"BCN\",\"duration\":1,\"credits\":90,\"credits_for_major\":60,\"credits_for_minor\":30,\"tuition_fee\":22900,\"description\":null,\"title\":\"Master of Engineering\"},\"time\":\"17:00:00\",\"classroom\":\"Data.Space\",\"academic_year\":